<title>POLAND: GDANSKI MAY NET RISES TO PLN 16.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI MAY NET RISES TO PLN 16.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 16.86 vs    0.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   20.44 vs    3.33</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 35.85 vs   30.18</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	74.72 vs   59.33</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 50.68 vs   16.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   75.21 vs   73.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		176.88 vs  160.65</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     351.61 vs  296.81</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
